<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11896" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cūnābŭla</span></b> ,
			ōrum, n.
		cunae, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a cradle</i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			Prop., <i><span class="en">Cic. Div. 1, 36, 79</span></i>.—Of the
				<i>resting-place</i> of young animals, <i><span class="en">Verg. G. 4,
				66</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 10, 33, 51, §
			99</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Meton.</b>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<i>The cradle</i>, i. e. <i>the earliest
				abode, dwellingplace</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Jovis parvi,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Prop.
				3</span></i>
			 (4), 1, 27: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">gentis nostrae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 3, 105</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b> Like
			our <i>cradle</i>, for <i>birth,
			origin</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">a primis cunabulis,</span>”
				<i>from earliest childhood</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					1, 3, 5</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">qui non in cunabulis sed in campo sunt consules
					facti,</span>”
				i. e. <i>not by their descent</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Cic. Agr. 2, 36, 100</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">a primis cunabulis hujus urbis conditae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">App. M. 2, p. 128, 27</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">juris,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Dig.
					1, 2, 2</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
